From: OCCTSwift ecosystem <noreply@secondmouse.au>
Subject: [PATCH] Modeling Algorithms - TopOpeBRepBuild CorrectUnclosedWire collects
 the edges to remove before removing them

CorrectUnclosedWire (TopOpeBRepBuild_Merge.cxx, called from TopOpeBRepBuild_Builder::MakeFaces)
calls BRep_Builder::Remove(aWire, ed) inside a TopoDS_Iterator loop over aWire. Remove frees the
list node the iterator stands on, and the next Next() reads freed memory. BRepFilletAPI_MakeFillet
reaches it through ChFi3d_Builder::Compute -> MergeSolid whenever fillet ends meet in the merge,
and the process dies with an uncatchable SIGSEGV: 20 of 20 runs on OCCT#1619's fillet_uaf.brep
(r = 1.25 on explode edges 26 and 35), 3 of 3 on each of OCCT#1430's two cases.

The edges with at most one vertex are now collected in a list while iterating and removed after
the iteration ends. The second loop, over the vertex to edge map, is unchanged: it removes from
the wire while walking a separate map, not the wire's own list.

Reported upstream as OCCT#1619 (and OCCT#1430, same site). Tracked as
SecondMouseAU/OCCTSwift#3335.

---
diff --git a/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKBool/TopOpeBRepBuild/TopOpeBRepBuild_Merge.cxx b/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKBool/TopOpeBRepBuild/TopOpeBRepBuild_Merge.cxx
--- a/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKBool/TopOpeBRepBuild/TopOpeBRepBuild_Merge.cxx
+++ b/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKBool/TopOpeBRepBuild/TopOpeBRepBuild_Merge.cxx
@@ -138,17 +138,20 @@
 static void CorrectUnclosedWire(TopoDS_Shape& aWire)
 {
   //  std::cout << "-------CorrectUnclosedWire" << std::endl;
-  BRep_Builder    BB;
-  TopoDS_Iterator tdi(aWire, false, false);
-  for (; tdi.More(); tdi.Next())
+  BRep_Builder BB;
+  // Collect first: BB.Remove frees the list node the iterator stands on.
+  NCollection_List<TopoDS_Shape> aBadEdges;
+  for (TopoDS_Iterator tdi(aWire, false, false); tdi.More(); tdi.Next())
   {
-    const TopoDS_Shape& ed  = tdi.Value();
-    int                 nbv = ed.NbChildren();
-    if (nbv <= 1)
+    const TopoDS_Shape& ed = tdi.Value();
+    if (ed.NbChildren() <= 1)
     {
-      //      std::cout << "Remove bad edge" << std::endl;
-      BB.Remove(aWire, ed);
+      aBadEdges.Append(ed);
     }
+  }
+  for (const TopoDS_Shape& aBadEdge : aBadEdges)
+  {
+    BB.Remove(aWire, aBadEdge);
   }

   NCollection_IndexedDataMap<TopoDS_Shape, NCollection_List<TopoDS_Shape>, TopTools_ShapeMapHasher>
